WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:01.767
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:02.701
I'm here with Michelle Pfeiffer

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.534
[ Cheering and applause ]
and we

00:00:04.534 --> 00:00:07.200
are about to go head-to-head

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.367
in a new game called
Sniff Cup Flip Cup.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:11.300
[ Cheering ]

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.434
-♪ Sniff Cup ♪

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:13.901
♪ Flip Cup ♪

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:15.200
-♪ Yeah ♪
-♪ Yeah ♪

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.467
Now, this is just like
the drinking game Flip Cup,

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:18.868
but with an extra challenge.

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:22.033
Each of these red SOLO cups
contains a different scent.

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:24.667
It could be any of the scents
on the screen behind us.

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:28.000
First, you flip the cup,
then you try to guess the scent.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.400
If you guess right,
you keep going.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.400
If you guess wrong,
you keep flipping.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.901
The first person to get
through all their cups wins.

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.634
Michelle, are you ready
for this?

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:37.601
-If you guess wrong,
you keep flipping.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:38.934
-Yes, that's correct.

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:40.801
-Then what happens?
-Then you got to keep flipping.

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:43.067
Then, once you flip it over,
then you get to sniff again,

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:44.801
try again.
-Okay, alright.

00:00:44.801 --> 00:00:45.767
-Have you done this before?

00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:47.267
-I was practicing a little.

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:48.434
-Yeah, okay, here we go.
Alright.

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:49.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:50.534
I've never played this.

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:52.133
[ Laughter ]
Okay, here we go.

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:54.334
3, 2, 1, good luck.

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:57.534
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Mellow funk plays ]

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:58.901
-Coconut.

00:00:58.901 --> 00:00:59.734
[ Ding ]

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:03.067
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:04.467
-Coconut!

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:05.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.567
-Aah!

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:10.234
Aah!

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:12.934
Aah!

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:15.667
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:20.367
-Uh, vanilla.

00:01:20.367 --> 00:01:21.334
No.
-Yeah.

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:22.267
-No, orange!

00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:23.267
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:23.267 --> 00:01:24.734
You got to flip!
You got to flip!

00:01:24.734 --> 00:01:27.968
-No!
-No, well, you didn't say
anything yet.

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:30.534
Oh, I go again.

00:01:30.534 --> 00:01:32.033
Coconut?
No, bubble gum, bubble gum!

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:32.968
[ Ding ]

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:34.100
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.634
-It doesn't smell,
so, what do I do now?

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:37.133
-You say, "Bubble gum."
-Bubble gum.

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:38.100
-That's right, go.
-Okay.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:38.767
-Go to the third one.

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:39.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:41.267
-It doesn't smell
like bubble gum.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:41.934
-It doesn't, really.

00:01:45.467 --> 00:01:46.133
Aah!

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:50.234
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:54.467
-Bacon!

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:55.234
[ Ding ]

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:58.033
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:58.934 --> 00:01:59.701
Ooh!

00:02:00.567 --> 00:02:01.234
-Aah!

00:02:05.801 --> 00:02:08.868
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.100
It's a hard one.

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:19.968
Aah!

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:22.534
Oh, my gosh!

00:02:22.534 --> 00:02:25.334
[ Laughter ]
Are you waiting for me?

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:26.801
Are you embarrassing me?
What are you doing?

00:02:26.801 --> 00:02:27.868
I want to quit!

00:02:27.868 --> 00:02:29.300
[ Laughter ]
-I don't know what it is!

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:30.400
Is it a Henry rose fragrance?
-Oh, no, you know,

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.200
it's something.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.601
Uh, wait.

00:02:32.601 --> 00:02:33.501
Wait, what is it?

00:02:33.501 --> 00:02:34.367
Something -- Coffee!

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:35.133
[ Ding ]

00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:38.033
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:46.167
It's weak!
Come on.

00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:47.367
-Aah!

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.534
No! No!
-Uh --

00:02:50.534 --> 00:02:51.834
No! No!
-Henry Rose fragrance?

00:02:51.834 --> 00:02:52.534
[ Dinging ]

00:02:52.534 --> 00:02:54.400
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.467
Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!

00:02:57.467 --> 00:03:04.634
♪♪

00:03:04.634 --> 00:03:06.267
I'm a good winner.
-I got to give it to you --

00:03:06.267 --> 00:03:07.834
-I'm a good winner.
-Yeah, yeah, you're really --

00:03:07.901 --> 00:03:10.100
-I'm a good winner.
I am not a sore winner.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.567
Michelle Pfeiffer, everybody.

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:13.901
[ Cheering and applause ]
Her fragrance line --

00:03:13.901 --> 00:03:16.200
Her fragrance line,
Henry Rose, is awesome.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.167
It's available at henryrose.com.

00:03:18.167 --> 00:03:19.267
Stick around.
We'll be right back

00:03:19.267 --> 00:03:20.934
with Lil Rel Howery, everybody.

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:21.968
[ Cheering and applause ]

